(7754825, 1282720, 75618, '<td valign="top">This looks wonderful, a nice relaxing quality time with family. The colors look great, especially with the pops of yellow and white in the grass. Very minor nitpicks - the vignetting looks a little harsh and I think I would have preferred a less centered placement for the family. This still gets my highest mark.</td>', 'This looks wonderful, a nice relaxing quality time with family. The colors look great, especially with the pops of yellow and white in the grass. Very minor nitpicks - the vignetting looks a little harsh and I think I would have preferred a less centered placement for the family. This still gets my highest mark.', '2023-07-24 19:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7754826, 1282693, 75618, '<td valign="top">sounds like a good time</td>', 'sounds like a good time', '2023-07-24 19:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7754827, 1282709, 75618, '<td valign="top">They found the spotlight.</td>', 'They found the spotlight.', '2023-07-24 19:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7754866, 1282429, 50695, '<td valign="top">oh if it were Bocce I would give you a 10. Just kidding! 7 for a good capture of a moment with all the subjects shadowed or blurred, as if to emphasize the game over the players.</td>', 'oh if it were Bocce I would give you a 10. Just kidding! 7 for a good capture of a moment with all the subjects shadowed or blurred, as if to emphasize the game over the players.', '2023-07-25 11:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7754867, 1282715, 50695, '<td valign="top">teleported out of her shoes!!</td>', 'teleported out of her shoes!!', '2023-07-25 11:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7754868, 1282693, 50695, '<td valign="top">garbage bag filter + ultra high contrast = sexy black and white.</td>', 'garbage bag filter + ultra high contrast = sexy black and white.', '2023-07-25 11:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7754879, 1282707, 163081, '<td valign="top">The black and white photo of a squirrel jumping off of a tree branch is well-composed and captures the moment of action. The squirrel is in mid-air, its body stretched out and its tail uncurled. The tree branch is the story in this picture and, providing a sense of scale and context. The use of black and white photography helps to highlight the details of the squirrel''s fur and the movement of its body. The trunk looks menacing as a crocodile head. Great capture.</td>', 'The black and white photo of a squirrel jumping off of a tree branch is well-composed and captures the moment of action. The squirrel is in mid-air, its body stretched out and its tail uncurled. The tree branch is the story in this picture and, providing a sense of scale and context. The use of black and white photography helps to highlight the details of the squirrel''s fur and the movement of its body. The trunk looks menacing as a crocodile head. Great capture.', '2023-07-25 12:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7754882, 1282718, 163081, '<td valign="top">The overall look of the image is clean and simple. The background circle is a little too blurry to see what it is (a cracker, a plate,...), However, there are no distracting elements in the frame. This allows the viewer to focus on the tomato slice and its details. Simple, yet effective.</td>', 'The overall look of the image is clean and simple. The background circle is a little too blurry to see what it is (a cracker, a plate,...), However, there are no distracting elements in the frame. This allows the viewer to focus on the tomato slice and its details. Simple, yet effective.', '2023-07-25 13:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7754883, 1282689, 163081, '<td valign="top">Yeah!!! That''s what I want to see in this challenge. Best way to show it.</td>', 'Yeah!!! That''s what I want to see in this challenge. Best way to show it.', '2023-07-25 13:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7754884, 1282721, 163081, '<td valign="top">The overall feeling of the photo is one of warmth and comfort. The steam from the coffee is inviting, and the light from the window is soft and inviting. The simplicity of the table and the lack of other objects in the photo create a sense of calm and tranquility.<br/> <br/>I would describe this photo as a "snapshot of a moment of peace." It is a simple, yet evocative image that captures the essence of a warm cup of coffee on a cold morning.<br/>I would like to know how you managed to get such a perfect steam coming out of that cup.</td>', 'The overall feeling of the photo is one of warmth and comfort. The steam from the coffee is inviting, and the light from the window is soft and inviting. The simplicity of the table and the lack of other objects in the photo create a sense of calm and tranquility. I would describe this photo as a "snapshot of a moment of peace." It is a simple, yet evocative image that captures the essence of a warm cup of coffee on a cold morning.I would like to know how you managed to get such a perfect steam coming out of that cup.', '2023-07-25 13:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7754885, 1282709, 163081, '<td valign="top">The cat with its sharp features and piercing eyes reminds me of a movie still from one of Alfred Hitchcock''s films. The strong contrast in the image creates a sense of mood and sense of suspense. Like the cat is trying to cover something terrible.</td>', 'The cat with its sharp features and piercing eyes reminds me of a movie still from one of Alfred Hitchcock''s films. The strong contrast in the image creates a sense of mood and sense of suspense. Like the cat is trying to cover something terrible.', '2023-07-25 13:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7754908, 1282707, 50864, '<td valign="top">I have lots of squirrels eating my tomatoes so not a fan of most squirrel photos but this is fantastic. Love the oof bits in the left upper corner and right side. Love the solid white around the textured branch. Even a cute squirrel in mid air. I actually let the squirrels take what they want of my fruit and vegetables. Im just hoping they dont invite all of their friends and relatives from the neighborhood over.</td>', 'I have lots of squirrels eating my tomatoes so not a fan of most squirrel photos but this is fantastic. Love the oof bits in the left upper corner and right side. Love the solid white around the textured branch. Even a cute squirrel in mid air. I actually let the squirrels take what they want of my fruit and vegetables. Im just hoping they dont invite all of their friends and relatives from the neighborhood over.', '2023-07-25 15:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7754910, 1282715, 50864, '<td valign="top">Clever, interesting.  Very nice color photograph.</td>', 'Clever, interesting.  Very nice color photograph.', '2023-07-25 15:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
